# Four Way Street: city blocks round the edge, streets between them, and
# an open square in the middle.

NAME Four Way Street
SYMMETRY ROT4
WALLS M Y
START 6 6 E

# A corner block, solid: a spiral fills its 3x3 cells.
MOVE 4 4
DRAW 6 4
DRAW 6 6
DRAW 4 6
DRAW 4 5
DRAW 5 5

# The next block along.
MOVE 11 4
DRAW 13 4
DRAW 13 6
DRAW 11 6
DRAW 11 5
DRAW 12 5
